  "editorial": {
    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "An extended devotional form: the antiphon through Virgo gloriosa et benedicta, followed by Domina nostra and the petitions to her Son. The continuation is attested in Latin prayer books beyond Poland and is not presented as part of the ancient antiphon.",
    "source": {
      "method": "The antiphon was transcribed from the Latin appendix to the Compendium of the Catechism and collated against the Enchiridion Indulgentiarum. The devotional continuation was collated between the requested Polish form and Christus Regnat; John Paul II's 1991 prayer at Jasna Gora independently attests the same invocations and petitions, with a different order of two titles.",
      "witnesses": "witnesses/orationes.sub-tuum-praesidium/",
      "apparatus": "witnesses/orationes.sub-tuum-praesidium/apparatus.json"
    },
